              "# Escalating U.S.-China trade war roils markets as Trump promises aid to farmers\nA container ship is unloaded at the Virginia International Gateway terminal in Norfolk. China has announced tariff hikes on $60 billion of U.S. goods in retaliation for President Trump's escalation of a trade dispute.\nA container ship is unloaded at the Virginia International Gateway terminal in Norfolk. China has announced tariff hikes on $60 billion of U.S. goods in retaliation for President Trump’s escalation of a trade dispute.",
